X1", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17466, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UZjpKe1E2jx1JX71scNZwe", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy, in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The first rollback attempt halted partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). A second rollback attempt to v2.3.0 completed successfully. Current status: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial-failure before re-promoting v2.3.1 or v2.3.1-rc (v2.3.1-rc was unhealthy in staging and has never been healthy in production)."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48066, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UZjpKe1E2jx1JX71scNZwe", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48066, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UZjpKe1E2jx1JX71scNZwe", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49199, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01AFc3RFGg6VyRXvvUthnX8F", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49499, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01AFc3RFGg6VyRXvvUthnX8F", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "